    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are pleased to offer for sale this excellent mid-terrace residence in turn-key condition in the popular east Galway area of Roscam. \n\nNo.11 Garrai Sheain is offered to market in excellent condition having been upgraded in recent years by the current owners. This is evident immediately upon entry noticeable in the quality fittings throughout & further highlighted by upgrades such as a new boiler & inserted stove. This has resulted in a quality B energy rating. \n\nComprising of approximately 68.6 sq.m throughout, the property offers well proportioned living & kitchen areas on the ground floor and tow large bedrooms upstairs, one availing of its own en-suite, and a main bathroom with modern finish. \n\nExternally, no.11 Garrai Sheain benefits from its own private garden with a solid-built shed & a sought after westerly aspect.\n\nGarrai Sheain is a small residential development in the east of Galway City in the popular Roscam locale. Situated in a cul-de-sac offering coming green space within the estate & nearby. \n\nThe Roscam area is popular with families due to the friendly environment & the ample amenities such as recreational parks, as well quality schools & sporting facilities. \n\nThe area is also popular due to its close proximity to several mult-national companies & business parks situated in east Galway City. \n\nNo.11 Garrai Sheain would be an ideal property for a variety of purchasers, due to the excellent condition, well proportioned accommodation & ideal setting. \n\nViewing is highly recommended. \n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact O'Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only. The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout. All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\n\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
